  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "2aff74e7-b64c-48e2-88b1-cec4bf40a431",
    "name": "Daring Foods Recipes API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Public, unauthenticated read access to the Daring recipe library at https://daring.com/recipes/ via the site's custom `recipes` post type on the WordPress REST API. This is by a wide margin the richest collection Daring Foods exposes: 208 published recipes at time of capture (observed in the X-WP-Total header), each classified by cooking method through the shared `category` taxonomy (Saute 22, Oven Baked 13, Air Fry 7, Microwave 7, Pan Fry 5, Grill Pan 5, Dutch Oven 1, Braise 1). Recipe bodies (ingredients, steps, timings) are stored in Advanced Custom Fields which this host does not expose over REST - the `acf` member is present but empty - so the API returns recipe identity, taxonomy, featured image ID and SEO metadata, and the full recipe must be read from the `link` URL. Daring Foods operates no developer program; this is the content API of its marketing site.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Daring Foods",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
